```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input-set --help
Administer single-use Run Input Sets

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input-set [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create an open immutable Run Input Set
  show    Show a Run Input Set and its manifest
  upload  Upload selected members to an open Run Input Set
  seal    Seal an uploaded Run Input Set
  delete  Logically delete a Run Input Set and schedule content cleanup
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
